<Base title="Bio" context="Bio">
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <h1 class="title">Jaromil</h1>
      <p class="meta">Denis Roio · b. 1977 · Lugano</p>
    </header>

    <div class="body essay">
      <p>
        Artist and hacker. His work moves between code and conceptual art: free software as
        an artistic medium, the aesthetics of computation, and the visibility of the systems
        that surround us.
      </p>
      <p>
        He has recently opened his art studio in Lugano, with new projects and works
        forthcoming.
      </p>
      <p class="todo">Full biography — forthcoming</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
